Modifications made for this package:

  src/bgzf.c    packInt16(), unpackInt16() and packInt32() are declared
                "static inline" rather than "inline", so that a definition is
                emitted in builds that do not inline them.

                The fprintf(stderr, ...) in bgzf_check_bgzf() is removed;
                R packages must not write to stderr directly.
